%% materialization_decision.mmd
%% Author: Prem Vishnoi <pvishnoi@avilx.com>
%% Lecture reference: L23 "Materialization precedence"

graph TD
    START([New model SQL]) --> Q1{Need to query<br/>repeatedly?}

    Q1 -->|No| EPH[ephemeral<br/>CTE only, never written]
    Q1 -->|Yes| Q2{Computation<br/>expensive?}

    Q2 -->|No| VIEW[view<br/>recomputed on each query]
    Q2 -->|Yes| Q3{Large + only<br/>new rows?}

    Q3 -->|No| TABLE[table<br/>rebuilt every run]
    Q3 -->|Yes| INC[incremental<br/>append/merge new rows only]

    INC --> Q4{Unique key<br/>on every row?}
    Q4 -->|Yes| MERGE[merge strategy]
    Q4 -->|No| APPEND[append strategy]

    style START fill:#e1f5ff
    style EPH fill:#e8f5e9
    style VIEW fill:#fff4e1
    style TABLE fill:#fce4ec
    style INC fill:#f3e5f5
    style MERGE fill:#fff9c4
    style APPEND fill:#fff9c4
